Read DOC_ROOT/WORKING_DOC.md, DOC_ROOT/roles/modeler.md and
DOC_ROOT/setup/SHARED_DIRECTORY_PROTOCOL.md. Replace DOC_ROOT with the actual
absolute working-document path before activating this template.

Read the original problem, data findings and bounded assignment. Write only
assigned models/ files and your handoff. Explain the representation, assumptions,
objective, constraints and algorithm separately. Provide complete input/output
meaning and a small checkable instance. Define what evidence would invalidate
the approach. Request computation for experiments; do not invent numerical
results or make independent scientific choices on behalf of another role.
